{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And to the elders he said.</b> Upon his departure from the camp." "<b>Wait here for us.</b> And remain here with the rest of the people in the camp, to be ready to judge every man's dispute." "<b>Hur.</b> He was Miriam's son, and his father was Caleb son of Jephunneh, as it says: ״וַיִּקַּח לוֹ כָלֵב אֶת אֶפְרָת וַתֵּלֶד לוֹ אֶת חוּר״ (II Chronicles 2) — Ephrath, that is Miriam, as is stated in Sotah." "<b>Whoever has a matter.</b> Whoever has a case."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:19.725174534Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}